+///
+/// Three spellings, because DWARF has three: `DW_AT_upper_bound: n` for a
+/// dimension of `n + 1` elements, `DW_AT_count: n` for a dimension of exactly
+/// `n`, and neither attribute for the incomplete `int a[]`.
+///
